      "quote": "One of the images depicted a completed transaction from A.T.'s Coinbase account to virtual currency address 0xfa0a50dc366e2f0a5381e4d4b5fede589ab633a9 for 242,209.53 USDC, which was worth approximately $242,209.00. This was the previously described transaction that A.T. made at Lopez's direction on or about May 10, 2025.",
